{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56522","headline":"还丹口诀 · 曹真人","name":"还丹口诀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"捉取东青龙，配与西白虎。\n更将南朱雀，会偶北玄武。\n四者穷其根，本来同宗祖。\n世人不知深，衆石多错悮。\n不解演阴阳，配合爲夫妇。\n阴阳气本变，始得俱相聚。\n就中最妙者，须得中央土。\n泥鑪不假法，运火心须苦。\n一日两卦候，进退依节度。\n细穷日月盈，莫遣失风雨。\n十月还丹成，身除贫病苦。\n沧海与桑田，变时君治覩。\n谁人得吾道，不得轻取与。\n容易泄天机，谪罚殃七祖。\n（《大还丹照监》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹真人","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56522.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56522","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}